 * Exposes hunter original state reads and actual initialization commands.
 * Inputs are the original role and installation data from feature consumers;
 * outputs retain the same readonly stored references and existing write contracts.
 * Before each read or installation, callers keep their own permission and
 * terminal checks; this port never validates, copies, freezes or stores state.
 * Exact named function bindings belong only to this feature state owner.
 */
